    "function": "is_known_safe_command(&[String]) -> bool",
    "extracted": "2026-08-15",
    "note": "Cases extracted from the official unit tests (mod tests, is_safe_command.rs:337-802). `platform`: all | linux | win32 — cases with a platform run only under that target. DSH counterpart: isSafeCommand(argv, { platform }) from policy/exec-policy.js."
